@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="privacy-container">
    <div class="glass-card privacy-card">
        <div class="privacy-header">
            <div class="privacy-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="privacy-subtitle">Last updated: May 2026 • Version 2.0</p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-intro">
            <p>At <strong>BrainSpark Quiz</strong>, we are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. If you have any questions or concerns about our policy, or our practices with regards to your personal information, please contact us.</p>
        </div>

        <hr class="privacy-divider" />

        <div class="privacy-sections">
            <section class="privacy-section">
                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when you register on our platform, express an interest in obtaining information about us, or participate in quiz activities on the services.</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> We collect usernames, passwords, email addresses, and similar security information used for authentication.</li>
                    <li><strong>Academic/User Profile:</strong> We collect details such as your role (Student or Teacher) and your name to customize your experience.</li>
                    <li><strong>Quiz Data:</strong> For students, we record details of quiz sessions, including start/end times, answers selected, and final scores. For teachers, we record custom quizzes, sections, and questions created.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="privacy-section">
                <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>We use personal information collected via our Services for a variety of business and educational purposes described below:</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li><strong>To Facilitate Account Creation &amp; Login:</strong> We use your details to allow you to create an account and log in.</li>
                    <li><strong>To Deliver &amp; Personalize Services:</strong> We process your quiz scores and progress to show you dashboard statistics and personalize your academic growth view.</li>
                    <li><strong>To Enable Teacher Evaluation:</strong> We share quiz session data and performance with the respective teachers to facilitate educational assessment.</li>
                    <li><strong>To Protect Our Services:</strong> We use information as part of our efforts to keep our platform safe and secure (for example, for fraud monitoring and preventing quiz cheating).</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="privacy-section">
                <h2>3. How We Share Your Information</h2>
                <p>We only share information with your consent, to comply with laws, to provide you with services, to protect your rights, or to fulfill business obligations.</p>
                <ul class="privacy-list">
                    <li><strong>With Teachers:</strong> If you are a student, your quiz results, duration, and score are visible to the teachers who created the quizzes.</li>
                    <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> We may disclose your information where we are legally required to do so to comply with applicable law, governmental requests, or judicial proceedings.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="privacy-section">
                <h2>4. Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>
                <p>We keep your information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this privacy policy unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law.</p>
                <p>We have implemented appropriate technical and organizational security measures designed to protect the security of any personal information we process. However, please also remember that we cannot guarantee that the internet itself is 100% secure.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="privacy-section">
                <h2>5. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
                <p>In some regions, you have certain rights under applicable data protection laws. These may include the right to request access and obtain a copy of your personal information, to request rectification or erasure, or to restrict the processing of your personal information. To make such a request, please use the contact details provided below.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="privacy-section">
                <h2>6. Updates to This Policy</h2>
                <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The updated version will be indicated by an updated "Revised" date and the updated version will be effective as soon as it is accessible.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="privacy-section contact-section">
                <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                <p>If you have questions or comments about this policy, you may email us at:</p>
                <a href="mailto:support@brainspark.edu" class="btn-primary privacy-contact-btn">
                    <span>📧</span> support@brainspark.edu
                </a>
            </section>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-footer-actions">
            <a asp-page="/Index" class="btn-secondary">Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
